# Local load-test baselines — captured by scripts/load-test-local.sh.
# Per-machine .txt files aren't committed (they'd be machine-specific
# noise). The single shared reference committed to the repo lives in
# .perf/BASELINE.md — see that file for the update workflow.
.perf/*
!.perf/BASELINE.md
